{"articleNo":"501625","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=501625&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [Call for Papers] ISITIA 2025 - IEEE indexing opportunity","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2024.11.08","hit":"7665","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoEZshNAigRwLbIA4FEDOBTAIwDMAvAQQIA8AFAKUoGsSA6DAOwHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We are pleased to announce the 26th International Seminar on Intelligent Technology and Its Applications (ISITIA) 2025, organized by the Department of Electrical Engineering, Institut Teknologi Sepuluh Nopember (ITS), Indonesia. This prestigious event is held annually and serves as a platform for researchers, academics, and industry professionals to share and discuss their latest advancements in intelligent technology and its various applications.&nbsp;</span><br></p><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Previous ISITIA papers have been indexed in IEEExplore (https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/conhome/1808025/all-proceedings) and papers that are accepted and presented at ISITIA 2025 will also be submitted for possible inclusion in IEEExplore.</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Conference Details:</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Date: 23-25 July 2025</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Venue: Hybrid (Offline and Onsite in Bumi Surabaya City Resort, Surabaya, Indonesia)</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Keynote speakers:&nbsp;</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. Prof. Rossa H. M. Chan</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Professor, Department of Electrical Engineering, City University of Hong Kong</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">VP-Finance, IEEE Engineering in Medicine &amp; Biology Society</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2. Prof. Heri Suryoatmojo</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Professor, Department of Electrical Engineering, Institut Teknologi Sepuluh Nopember, Indonesia</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Director of Renewable Energy Integration Demonstrator of Indonesia (REIDI), ITS</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. TBA</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Important Dates:</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Paper Submission Page Open: 1 December 2024</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Paper Submission Deadline: 25 March 2025&nbsp;</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Notification of Acceptance: 1 May 2025&nbsp;</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Final Paper Submission: 2 June 2025</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">For detailed submission guidelines, please visit our official&nbsp;<b>website: https://elib.its.ac.id/conf/isitia/main/</b>&nbsp;or contact the organizing committee at&nbsp;<b>isitia@its.ac.id</b></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We invite you to submit your high-quality papers on a range of topics related to intelligent technologies, including but not limited to:</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"># Control System Engineering</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Robotics</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Industrial Automation</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Autonomous Vehicles</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- System and Network Reliability</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Perception and Navigation</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"># Electronics</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- VLSI</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Embedded Systems</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Sensors</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- IoT Devices</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Biomedical Circuits</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Data Converters</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Mixed-Signal Circuits</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Microelectronics</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"># Power and Energy Systems</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Renewable Energy</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- High-Voltage Engineering</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Energy Conversion</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- AI in Power Systems</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Energy Storage</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">#Telecommunications &amp; Signal Processing</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Antenna and Microwave Engineering</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Signal Processing</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Telecommunication Network and Services</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Radar and Remote Sensing Technology</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Wireless and Mobile Communication</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Software-Defined Radio</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"># Information Technology</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Information Systems</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Telematics</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Security</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- ICT</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Artificial Intelligence</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Virtual Reality</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- IT in Education</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"># Biomedical Engineering</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- e-Health</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Rehabilitation Engineering and Assistive Technology</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Biomedical Informatics</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Biomedical Instrumentation and Signal Processing</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Biomedical Imaging and Image Processing</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Artificial Intelligence for Medicine</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We look forward to receiving your contributions and welcoming you to ISITIA 2025!</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Best regards,</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ISITIA 2025 Organizing Committee</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Department of Electrical Engineering</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Institut Teknologi Sepuluh Nopember (ITS)</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Surabaya, Indonesia</div><div style=\"font-family: Kartika, &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;Malayalam MN&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Website: https://elib.its.ac.id/conf/isitia/main/<br>Email: isitia@its.ac.id</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
